### Description
This Terraform program sets up a VPC with private and public subnets, creates two RDS instances (one internal and one public), and configures Route 53 to direct internal users to the internal RDS instance and external users to the public RDS instance. The program includes necessary IAM roles and configurations to ensure proper access and routing.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_vpc" "main_vpc" {
  cidr_block           = "10.0.0.0/16"
  enable_dns_support   = true
  enable_dns_hostnames = true
}

resource "aws_subnet" "private_subnet" {
  vpc_id                  = aws_vpc.main_vpc.id
  cidr_block              = "10.0.1.0/24"
  availability_zone       = "us-west-2a"
  map_public_ip_on_launch = false
}

resource "aws_subnet" "public_subnet" {
  vpc_id                  = aws_vpc.main_vpc.id
  cidr_block              = "10.0.2.0/24"
  availability_zone       = "us-west-2b"
  map_public_ip_on_launch = true
}

resource "aws_db_subnet_group" "main_db_subnet_group" {
  name       = "main-db-subnet-group"
  subnet_ids = [aws_subnet.private_subnet.id, aws_subnet.public_subnet.id]
}

resource "aws_rds_instance" "internal_rds" {
  identifier              = "internal-db"
  engine                  = "mysql"
  engine_version          = "8.0"
  instance_class          = "db.t3.micro"
  allocated_storage       = 20
  username                = "admin"
  password                = "password"
  db_subnet_group_name    = aws_db_subnet_group.main_db_subnet_group.name
  skip_final_snapshot     = true
  publicly_accessible     = false
  vpc_security_group_ids  = [aws_security_group.internal_sg.id]
}

resource "aws_rds_instance" "public_rds" {
  identifier              = "public-db"
  engine                  = "mysql"
  engine_version          = "8.0"
  instance_class          = "db.t3.micro"
  allocated_storage       = 20
  username                = "admin"
  password                = "password"
  db_subnet_group_name    = aws_db_subnet_group.main_db_subnet_group.name
  skip_final_snapshot     = true
  publicly_accessible     = true
  vpc_security_group_ids  = [aws_security_group.public_sg.id]
}

resource "aws_security_group" "internal_sg" {
  name        = "internal-sg"
  description = "Security group for internal RDS"
  vpc_id      = aws_vpc.main_vpc.id

  ingress {
    from_port   = 3306
    to_port     = 3306
    protocol    = "tcp"
    cidr_blocks = ["10.0.0.0/16"]
  }

  egress {
    from_port   = 0
    to_port     = 0
    protocol    = "-1"
    cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
  }
}

resource "aws_security_group" "public_sg" {
  name        = "public-sg"
  description = "Security group for public RDS"
  vpc_id      = aws_vpc.main_vpc.id

  ingress {
    from_port   = 3306
    to_port     = 3306
    protocol    = "tcp"
    cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
  }

  egress {
    from_port   = 0
    to_port     = 0
    protocol    = "-1"
    cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
  }
}

resource "aws_route53_zone" "private_zone" {
  name = "private.example.com"
}

resource "aws_route53_zone" "public_zone" {
  name = "public.example.com"
}

resource "aws_route53_record" "private_db_record" {
  zone_id = aws_route53_zone.private_zone.zone_id
  name    = "db.private.example.com"
  type    = "A"
  records = [aws_rds_instance.internal_rds.endpoint]
  ttl     = 300
}

resource "aws_route53_record" "public_db_record" {
  zone_id = aws_route53_zone.public_zone.zone_id
  name    = "db.public.example.com"
  type    = "A"
  records = [aws_rds_instance.public_rds.endpoint]
  ttl     = 300
}
```

