This Terraform script configures an OIDC identity provider for an AWS EKS cluster named "example". It includes the creation of an EKS cluster, an IAM OIDC provider, and an EKS identity provider configuration linked to the cluster. The script ensures that the resources are created in the correct order, respecting their dependencies.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

