This Terraform configuration sets up the following resources:
1. An S3 bucket named `video-content-bucket-<random-suffix>` for storing video content.
2. A CloudFront origin access control resource to secure the S3 bucket.
3. A CloudFront distribution with the S3 bucket as its origin, configured to allow GET and HEAD methods, and restricted to specific geographic locations.
4. A Route53 zone for the domain `netflix.com`.
