This Terraform configuration sets up a VPC with public and private subnets, an internet gateway, a public route table, an application load balancer, two EC2 instances in the private subnet, and a Route53 record to point a domain to the load balancer. The security groups are configured to allow HTTP traffic between the load balancer and the EC2 instances.

