This Terraform script sets up a VPC, a public subnet, an internet gateway, a route table, a security group, an EC2 instance, a Network Load Balancer, a target group, and a listener. The EC2 instance is launched in the public subnet and registered as a target in the target group, which is then attached to the listener of the NLB.

